OL,3,GNEWSAGavin and Stacey creators Jones
OL,4,Aand Corden reveal cast of new show
OL,5,
OL,6,FGavin and Stacey co-creators Ruth Jones
OL,7,Fand James Corden have revealed details
OL,8,Fabout their new TV comedy drama series
OL,9,FThe Choir.
OL,11,FThe eight-episode show will air on
OL,12,FApple TV and feature guest appearances
OL,13,Fby Hannah Waddingham, James McAvoy and
OL,14,FJim Broadbent.
OL,16,FThe series follows brother Ben (Corden)
OL,17,Fand sister Lisa (Jones), who have not
OL,18,Fseen each other for several years.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
